window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-134-85cfd42174de1aac.json"]={sha256:"85cfd42174de1aac21678494aa79928b943aa3b542dbcce9842824b7ad2b1da3",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-047ba09e77c63aef","url":"https://ccsds.org/publications/bluebooks/","title":"CCSDS Blue Books: Recommended Standards","titleEn":"CCSDS Blue Books: Recommended Standards","publisher":"CCSDS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-134","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-134","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-135","referenceUrls":["https://ccsds.org/publications/bluebooks/"],"title":"CCSDS AOS：虛擬通道配額與壅塞隔離","titleEn":"CCSDS AOS: virtual-channel quotas and congestion isolation","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 99.21875 percent useful bytes 與 96.875 percent useful bytes，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 99.21875 percent useful bytes and 96.875 percent useful bytes, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋20000 bytes for VC-A per cycle與16000 bytes for VC-A per cycle，建立aos_slots.csv、各VC累積佇列、18/14替代配置與隔離證據，並完成以下驗收：若每循環A需18000、B需14000 byte，兩種固定配額皆至少一方失敗；應提出18/14而非挑較高總量。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 20000 bytes for VC-A per cycle and 16000 bytes for VC-A per cycle; create aos_slots.csv, per-VC queue totals and evidence for an isolated18/14 alternative; apply this acceptance decision: For per-cycle demands A18000 and B14000 bytes, both proposed quotas fail one channel; propose18/14 instead of selecting by total capacity.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 將教學框分成標頭、資料與校驗，可分別量測開銷與錯誤偵測；吞吐效率不能證明資料正確。 展開基準式 (1024-6-2)/1024*100；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：實際建立byte索引0到長度-1，逐個標記6標頭與2尾端byte；資料計數應為1016或248。 將兩條推導一起存入 tm_layout.csv、byte欄位示意、開銷與完整性分開報告。","從原理 固定循環排程把框機會分配給虛擬通道；總容量不變時，提高一通道配額必降低另一通道保留量。 展開基準式 20*1000；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：產生32列槽表，統計A/B計數20/12或16/16；兩通道交付合計永遠不超32000 byte。 將兩條推導一起存入 aos_slots.csv、各VC累積佇列、18/14替代配置與隔離證據。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Separating a teaching frame into header, data and check fields distinguishes overhead from error detection; efficiency alone does not establish integrity., expand baseline expression (1024-6-2)/1024*100; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Build byte indices from0 to length-1 and mark6 header and2 trailing bytes; data counts must be1016 or248. Save both derivations with tm_layout.csv, a byte-field diagram and separate overhead/integrity reports.","Starting from A cyclic schedule allocates frame opportunities to virtual channels; at fixed total capacity an increased quota for one reduces the reserved capacity of another., expand baseline expression 20*1000; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Generate32 schedule rows and count A/B as20/12 or16/16; combined delivery never exceeds32000 bytes. Save both derivations with aos_slots.csv, per-VC queue totals and evidence for an isolated18/14 alternative.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-144","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.650.1-202401-I/en"],"title":"雙向 OTDR：消除熔接假增益","titleEn":"Bidirectional OTDR: eliminate apparent splice gain","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 99.21875 percent useful bytes 與 96.875 percent useful bytes，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 99.21875 percent useful bytes and 96.875 percent useful bytes, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學熔接容許0.3 dB；名義0.2通過，變更0.4需復查；單向負值不作通過依據。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching splice limit0.3 dB:0.2 passes and0.4 needs review; a negative one-way reading is not a pass criterion.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 將教學框分成標頭、資料與校驗，可分別量測開銷與錯誤偵測；吞吐效率不能證明資料正確。 展開基準式 (1024-6-2)/1024*100；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：實際建立byte索引0到長度-1，逐個標記6標頭與2尾端byte；資料計數應為1016或248。 將兩條推導一起存入 tm_layout.csv、byte欄位示意、開銷與完整性分開報告。","合成A→B熔接0.8 dB、B→A為−0.4 dB；變更為0.9與−0.1 dB。 名義式 (0.8-0.4)/2 = 0.2 dB；變更式 (0.9-0.1)/2 = 0.4 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 反向座標換算到同一物理熔接，再平均；以穿透式損耗量測檢查總路徑，不能平均不對應事件。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Separating a teaching frame into header, data and check fields distinguishes overhead from error detection; efficiency alone does not establish integrity., expand baseline expression (1024-6-2)/1024*100; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Build byte indices from0 to length-1 and mark6 header and2 trailing bytes; data counts must be1016 or248. Save both derivations with tm_layout.csv, a byte-field diagram and separate overhead/integrity reports.","Synthetic A-to-B splice0.8 dB and reverse−0.4 dB; changed readings0.9 and−0.1 dB. Nominal (0.8-0.4)/2 = 0.2 dB; changed (0.9-0.1)/2 = 0.4 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Map reverse coordinates to the same physical splice before averaging; verify total insertion loss and never average different events.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-047ba09e77c63aef","url":"https://ccsds.org/publications/bluebooks/","title":"CCSDS Blue Books: Recommended Standards","titleEn":"CCSDS Blue Books: Recommended Standards","publisher":"CCSDS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-1348db92caa214bd","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.650.1-202401-I/en","title":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","titleEn":"ITU-T G.650.1: Definitions and test methods for linear deterministic fibre attributes","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
